{"a2uiMeta":{"note":"I check behind, and the turn is the **K♦**. The board is now 9♠ 4♥ 2♣ K♦ and the pot is still 20.

Last turn I described round 2 but never actually built its table, so I've built it now as table-2. Your hole cards are 5♦ 6♣ J♦ 10♥. I've also removed the Deal again button from round 1, so only this table takes moves now.

